    <string name="tutorial_progress">Page %1$d of %2$d</string>
    <string name="tutorial_welcome_title">Welcome to Wrap</string>
    <string name="tutorial_welcome_body">Every booking, every hour on set and every dirham you\'re owed, in one place. Here\'s a quick tour.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_jobs_title">Add your jobs</string>
    <string name="tutorial_jobs_body">Tap + to add an upcoming booking or log a job you\'ve already done. Set the day rate, call time and location. Wrap works out overtime, VAT and when you should be paid.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_day_title">On the day</string>
    <string name="tutorial_day_body">Clock in and out from Home, the job or the home-screen widget. You get a reminder the night before and before call time. Keep crew contacts, unit base and parking on the job\'s call sheet.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_paid_title">Get paid</string>
    <string name="tutorial_paid_body">Record payments as they come in. Send an invoice PDF from the job and tap Chase to send a polite WhatsApp reminder. Wrap reminds you when a payment has gone a week overdue.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_spend_title">Track your spending</string>
    <string name="tutorial_spend_body">Log fuel, kit and other costs with a receipt photo. Bill a cost to a job to charge it back, make it repeat every month, and set a monthly budget on the Money tab.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_reports_title">See how you\'re doing</string>
    <string name="tutorial_reports_body">The Reports tab: your year with a CSV for your accountant, how each client performs, who owes you and for how long, and your days and rates.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_safe_title">Keep it safe</string>
    <string name="tutorial_safe_body">In Settings, add your details for invoices, back up to Google Drive, and lock the app with your fingerprint. You can open this tour again from Settings.</string>
